src/common_domain_model/schema/ is a derivative of the Rosetta files under
rosetta-source/src/main/rosetta/ and of the code lists under
rosetta-source/src/main/resources/codelist/json/, which
scripts/rosetta_to_linkml.py reads. Its structure is this project's. Every
description of a type, attribute, enumeration and value, and every code of a
code list, is the CDM's, carried as written. The descriptions of FpML's codes and
the text of the ISDA, ICMA and other documents the CDM cites by docReference are
left out. src/common_domain_model/datamodel/, project/ and docs/schema/ are
generated from the schema, and carry the same descriptions.

